<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Handles the action of clearing specific temporary folders within the application.</para>

<para>This class is responsible for clearing out temporary files and directories that are not essential for immediate functionality but may accumulate over time and use disk space. It targets temporary directories used by various components like Composer, OpenSSL, and others. </para>
