<para>Constructor for the <link linkend="_class_action_clear_folders">ActionClearFolders</link> class.</para>

<para>Upon instantiation, it clears specified temporary folders in both the root and core temporary paths. It excludes certain files and folders from being deleted to prevent essential data loss.</para>

