<para>Clears specific temporary folders in the root temporary path.</para>

<para><link linkend="_class_util_1ab37afa6922711777e872b6adb54c71a6">Util\clearFolder</link> is used to clear the contents of the root temporary path, excluding certain essential items such as &apos;cachegrind&apos;, &apos;composer&apos;, &apos;openssl&apos;, &apos;mailpit&apos;, &apos;xlight&apos;, &apos;npm-cache&apos;, &apos;pip&apos;, &apos;opcache&apos; and &apos;.gitignore&apos;. This ensures that important data and configurations are not lost.</para>

