                Clears the core temporary path.</para>

<para><link linkend="_class_util_1ab37afa6922711777e872b6adb54c71a6">Util\clearFolder</link> is used to clear the contents of the core temporary path, excluding the &apos;.gitignore&apos; file. This ensures that the core temporary path is cleaned without removing the &apos;.gitignore&apos; file which might be necessary for version control.</para>

